Dolly the valkyrie searched dlvl 1, nothing special. Okay, down to dlvl
2 here's a neutral altar. Kill a newt, #offer it, but unluckily Dolly
felt the power of Loki decrease. How about something a bit tougher? A
kobold walks in, Dolly's faithful dog Esko A. (to honor the Finnish
prime minister) kills the poor creature. Dolly takes the kobold's bloody
corpse and offers it to her god. And the newly converted altar shines
black. Okay, now to offerin' more beasts. A couple of newts and a gecko
find themselves to be sacrificed in the chaotic woman's religious rites.

As looking more creatures to be sacrificed Dolly finds another neutral
altar and sacrifices a gnome on it, but the power of Loki decreases. Another
gnome and the power of her god still goes weaker. Dolly runs to the
other altar to conciliate Loki, but she faints of the lack of food on
the way. Carrying no food, she takes a chance and prays. Loki is pleased
and her hunger fades. She goes now to the altar and kills a little newt
on the way and decides to start the sacrificing with it, the newt is
accepted in a burst of flame and what... a object appears at Dollys
feet. Holy moses... (I thought that Loki's power was down and I had just
prayed) well the object was a axe named Cleaver, a gecko comes in and
Dolly sacrifices it. An object appears at her feet... Holy Moly
Maccaroni... this is too good to be true, and it isn't even Full Moon
tonight. It was an orcish dagger named Grimtooth. 

Okay, now we're in business. Dolly offers a werejackal and a Demon Lord
appears and scares the shit out of her pants (actually she is still
wearing only her enchanted shield). But Juiblex takes no intrest in her.
Another werething attacks her. The human-rat get killed and sacrificed. 
Another Demon, this time Yeenoghu appears and grunts at Dolly. Dolly
sacrifices still a few wimpy beasts and a third weapon is given to her
by Loki. This time it's the mighty Stormbringer.

Dolly is now lvl 6 and she decides to go up to dlvl 1 to try something
with that fountain she found there. #Dipp the long sword a couple of
times, and what happens... a murky hand blesses the the sword.

This is going to be some great adventure, so far Dolly has: 
Exalibur, Cleaver, Stormbringer and Grimtooth. A stupid hobbit gets on
her way and she kills it with one slash with Stormbringer. She finds a
elven dagger and names it Sting.

Back to dlvl 2 and Dolly kills a dwarf, dwarf has the normal dwarf-stuff
with it plus a intresting red potion. Dolly takes a good sip from the
potion and... wow she is having a great trip in the multicoloured space
of hallucination. She wonders around killing beasts with Stormbringer,
still being carefull not to attack the mighty Demons.
Hey, whats that a floating eye? Without thinking she attacks the sphere
and ... NO SHIT , it was Juiblex, Dolly panics and hits the demon a few
times as it engulfs her. What the ..., Stormy doesn't work properly, and
then she remembers: Stormy does not drain life from undead or demons,
but she still has a trick. Thanking Loki to be still alive she wields
Excalibur and slashes Juiblex with it. Another slash and Juiblex is
suffering, but... the acid in the Demons stomach are just a bit too much
to our brave but stupid valkyrie -- She gasps once and dies.

In heaven Dolly sees a highscore-list, and she isn't even on it. :(




